    "type": "md",
    "html": "<h1>Striking</h1>\n<p>You capture by arriving. Move a piece so that it lands next to an enemy, and\nthat enemy is struck: it stays on its point but flips to your colour and joins\nyour side. Nothing is removed from the board. A game of Tarati is won by\nconverting pieces, not by clearing them.</p>\n<p>One move can convert several pieces at once. Every enemy standing next to your\npiece's destination is struck together.</p>"
