    "type": "md",
    "html": "<h2>The rule that makes Tarati Tarati</h2>\n<p>There is one condition on striking, and it is the whole character of the game:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You cannot strike an enemy you were already standing next to. To capture a\npiece, you must arrive from a point that was not adjacent to it.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Read that once and it sounds like a footnote. Watch it decide a single move and\nit stops being one.</p>"
